      "value": "<p>One rune in particular has your attention.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Runes class feature</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Choose a rune that you know. Whenever you replenish your inscription pool, you gain 2 temporary inscription points that last for 24 hours. These temporary inscription points may only be spent on activating the chosen rune.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/runesmithing-feats#toc6\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
